-- beleza-tamboerskloof (researched)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Beleza is a Portuguese-Italian restaurant and bar in Tamboerskloof, serving traditional Iberian fare and coffee since it opened in 2005. The restaurant sits alongside its on-site vintage boutique, Lembrancas, in one of Cape Town''s hipster strongholds.

