UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Technoline Projects is a 20-year-old engineering design, project management and contracting firm based in Thornton, originally founded to serve the cellular and telecommunications industries. The company provides engineering design, project management and contracting services, and lists telecoms infrastructure among its areas of work.

